# Shell scripts, the generated commit-msg hook, and the Python tools must be stored with
# LF in the repository regardless of any contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Windows
# checkouts tolerate CRLF, but a CRLF shebang fails outright on Linux and macOS, and this
# kit is meant to run on all three from the same checkout.
*.sh        text eol=lf
commit-msg  text eol=lf
*.py        text eol=lf
*.sql       text eol=lf
